ANNEX.text:
${P} RESEARCH REPORT #${ctx.seed * ctx.hours % 666}
AUTHOR: ${c.lead}

It doesn't use the doors.

It doesn't need the doors.

Why did we build doors?

INTERNAL SMTP SERVER REPORT: UNSENT MAIL

FROM: ${c.lost}
TO: ${c.lead}

You keep saying "containment" like the word still means something here. I measured my office again last night. It has been growing by four centimeters a week.

I have stopped reporting it because you have stopped reading these!

${P} OBSERVATION REPORT NO. ${100 + (ctx.seed % 800)}
AUTHOR: ${c.staff-member-1}

The architectural shifts are directly proportional to the observer's heart rate.

The walls might look like they are moving, but they aren't. The space *between( them is... breathing.

${c.lost} disagrees. They have been in the halls ${hrs} hours and I no longer consider their ${c.lost}'s disagreements to be anything but manic delusion, now. They are truly lost.

ARCHIVE.text:
PERSONNEL RECORD: ${LOST}

STATUS: SEE ADDENDUM

ADDENDUM: MISSING

ADDENDUM 2: The addendum is not missing. It's just waiting to be found.

— ${c.archivist}

REQUISITION SLIP # ${ctx.seed}

REQUESTED: 1 (one) additional copy of the floor plan

VERDICT: DENIED

REASON: The floor plan is a living document. Duplication causes local drift. 

— ${c.archivist}

BOARDROOM.text:
QUARTERLY REVIEW MINUTES, PROJECT ${P}
CHAIR: ${c.lead}

Motion to extend the perimeter survey: carried.
Motion to extend it again after the first survey returned a different perimeter: carried.
Motion to stop surveying: carried unanimously, and nobody would clarify further.

Motion for lunch: carried.

CHASM.text:
[SIGHTING REPORT: CHASM LEVEL]

${c.custodian} reports a figure on the opposing catwalk at hour ${hrs}, matching ${c.lost}, moving away and unhurried. Opposing catwalk was struck for scrap before the site opened. Its anchors are still in the wall, but is otherwise inaccessible.

-${c.lead}

IMPOUND.text:
Has anyone seen my cat, Meepis? His food bowl and litter have moved somewhere and I can't find any of the three. :(

I knew I shouldn't have brought him to work...

- ${c.staff-member-1}

EXIT.text:
CUSTODIAL SHIFT ROTA: EXTRACTION POINT, ${ctx.siteYear + 25}, WEEK 12

MON  ${c.custodian}
TUE  ${c.custodian}
WED  ${c.custodian}
THU  ${c.custodian}
FRI  ${c.custodian}

[In the margin, different pen]: "I have asked four times for a second name on this list."

If you are reading this you got out, which means you got further than most and further than me. There is water in the locker. Take it, it is not rationed up here.

I keep this desk. It is the only part of the building I am sure of. Go up.

- ${c.custodian}

ACME.text:
DECK COUNT, WEEK ${WEEK}

Levels surveyed from the entrance ring down: sixty-one.

Levels surveyed from the entrance ring up: four.

Same catwalk, same ladder, same afternoon. I climbed it both directions myself.

Facilities says to average the two numbers for the incident report. I am not doing that. Thirty-two and a half decks is not a real place to stand.

- ${c.custodian}
